+					printf ("%8s Inode      node at 0x%08zx, totlen 0x%08x, #ino  %5d, ve=
rsion %5d, isize %8d, csize %8d, dsize %8d, offset %8d\n",
+							obsolete ? "Obsolete" : "",
+							p - file_buffer, je32_to_cpu (node->i.totlen), je32_to_cpu (node->i=
.ino),
+							je32_to_cpu ( node->i.version), je32_to_cpu (node->i.isize),
+							je32_to_cpu (node->i.csize), je32_to_cpu (node->i.dsize), je32_to_c=
pu (node->i.offset));
